The {{zone|Hexatorum}} is a [[Location]] within the {{Zone|Museum}} on the [[Hub Island]]. Is features {{NPCSprite|The Handler}} and the [[The Hex]], the latter of which is only usable once the player has achieved the [[Museum|{{Green|Museum Milestone 8}}]].

{{ZoneText|Talk to &5The Handler&f.|Use &dThe Hex&f.}}

